                        "entry_id": "4a212912-f480-3ae2-b65d-7fc3b1673b08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state of being heathen."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e2d9e96-9327-400d-a1d9-bc60bb16cd27",
                                "sense_id": "97430f8f-12d1-3f27-a8c8-48e45a62761a",
                                "text": "It was as though she were some tinted and lavishly adorned statue of barbaric heathenry, and he her postulant; and her large eyes appeared to judge an immeasurable path, beyond him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6aee6c76-f7e3-4479-83c6-307aa42a5db4",
                                "sense_id": "97430f8f-12d1-3f27-a8c8-48e45a62761a",
                                "text": "In the simpler case of northern heathenry the civilization spread with a simplier progress."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
